  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHC59FFB32F6968CC9EC45EDD11833A5A4" xlink:label="HHC59FFB32F6968CC9EC45EDD11833A5A4" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHFFDE7EAF189D0C37E1E84697EFC1E02C" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Dividend paid to members in Q1 2025 is $91,700,000. Dividend paid from Additional Paid-In Capital is $29,636,693 while $62,063,307 was paid from Retained Income.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHC59FFB32F6968CC9EC45EDD11833A5A4" xlink:to="HHFFDE7EAF189D0C37E1E84697EFC1E02C" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH7D78C762E66813ADA9370A733A6A133F" xlink:label="HH7D78C762E66813ADA9370A733A6A133F" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHAB713A93DB12CFC1275C8761F34F482B" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Distributions paid to members during the three month period ended March 31, 2026 were $77,500,000 . Distirbutions paid from Additional Paid-In Capital were $25,739,341 while Distributions paid from Unappropriated Retained Income were $51,760,659.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
